        <ul class="list-disc ml-5 sm:ml-6 mt-2 space-y-1.5 sm:space-y-0">
          <li>
            Built an order-management system (OMS) that brings orders from 4
            marketplaces and 1,700+ websites into one workflow. It has processed
            390K+ website orders and 90K+ marketplace orders.
          </li>
          <li>
            Automated inventory sync: prices and stock levels are imported from
            Google Sheets and pushed to warehouses in background jobs, with a
            dry-run mode for safe rollout.
          </li>
          <li>
            Added full-text order search with Typesense and analytics dashboards
            showing sales by platform, city and month.
          </li>
          <li>
            Designed asynchronous processing on a Redis queue with 30+ scheduled
            jobs and systemd workers. Deployed with CI/CD on GitHub Actions to
            separate dev and production environments.
          </li>
          <li>
            Modernized the frontend: React + TypeScript widgets inside Yii2, a
            move from Parcel to Vite, and CSS Modules with a reusable UI
            component layer.
          </li>
          <li>
            Automated the management domains through the Cloudflare and Beget
            APIs, including SSL certificate expiry tracking
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Wordpress Engineer</h3>
        <a
          class="inline-block"
          href="https://k3-tent.com/developer-of-k3-tent/"
          target="_blank"><h3 class="text-md font-bold">GeoS Center</h3></a
        >
        <p class="text-gray-600">May 2015 – August 2017</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-5 sm:ml-6 mt-2 space-y-1.5 sm:space-y-0">
          <li>
            Developed a WordPress plugin with multifunctional admin panel (order
            management, analytics, third-party integrations).
          </li>
          <li>
            Developed and localized 11 WordPress websites, each dedicated to a
            specific software product of the company.
          </li>
          <li>
            Gained hands-on experience with CMS customization, building
            solutions adopted across the company’s product line.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 sm:mt-4">
    <p>
      Startup-minded engineer who has shipped products across many early-stage
      projects, finding fast, practical solutions under tight timelines. I
      follow AI developments daily and turn new findings into working
      architectural decisions. Extensive experience mentoring engineers and
      building team processes, from code review standards to AI-assisted
      development workflows.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 sm:mt-4">
    <h2 class="font-semibold text-xl">Education</h2>
    <p class="sm:ml-3 mt-1">
      <strong
        >Master of Science in Computer Science | State Technical University
        n.a. R.E. Alekseev</strong
      > (2007 - 2012)
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 sm:mt-6 text-center">
    <p>🚀 Open to new opportunities and collaborations!</p>
  </section>
</div>
